cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: shadowbank-screen
abstract: >-
  Screens wire activity against the findings in FinCEN's Financial Trend Analysis "Iranian Shadow
  Banking: Update on Trends in Bank Secrecy Act Data" (November 23, 2026): bank-location routes to
  the UAE, registration and banking splits, free-zone and Marshall Islands or BVI registration at
  shared addresses, young and opaque companies with no web presence, multimillion wires without
  source-of-funds information or outside the line of business, bursts, absent operating expenses
  and shared counterparties. Clusters flagged parties, estimates activity not yet attributed with
  chain-ladder development and Mack standard errors, and back-tests each check against recorded
  outcomes. Engineering checklist, not legal advice.
authors:
